==>Array List :

List<String> cities = new ArrayList<>();
cities.add("Tenkasi");
cities.add("Shencottah");
cities.add("Elathur");
System.out.println("First City in the List is "+cities.get(0)); // Accessing the element is fast 0(1)
cities.set(0,"Courtrallam"); //replacing tenkasi with courtrallam
cities.remove("Shencottah"); // removing the data is very slow 0(n)

==>Linked List :

LinkedList<String> cities = new LinkedList<>();
cities.add("Tenkasi");
cities.add("Shencottah");
cities.add("Elathur");
cities.remove("Shencottah"); // removing the data is very slow 0(n)
System.out.println("First City in the List is "+cities.get(0)); // Accessing the element is fast 0(n)
cities.remove("Shencottah"); // removing the data is very slow 0(1)
cities.addFirst("Panpoli"); // Inserting is fast 0(1)
cities.addLast("Vadakarai"); // Inserting is fast 0(1)
cities.set(0,"Courtrallam"); //replacing tenkasi with courtrallam
